      "id": "markdown-4",
      "kind": "text",
      "name": "A browser editor with a filtered key list, explicit…",
      "text": "A browser editor with a filtered key list, explicit statuses (draft, needs review, approved), typed `{{name}}` variables and plural rules. Import and export for JSON, World, Xcode String Catalogs, Xcode `.strings` and `.stringsdict`, and Android `strings.xml`, failing explicitly rather than losing information. AI fill that saves values as needing review, Memory files attached as translation guidelines, optional automatic translation per location, and agent tools in the NullDull client.",
